+        check("重複情境 → 不說一個結果檔都沒讀成功", "一個結果檔都沒讀成功" not in r.stdout, r.stdout)
+        r = _mb_run(root, "--json")
+        d = json.loads(r.stdout) if r.stdout.strip().startswith("{") else {}
+        dup = [f for f in d.get("failed", []) if "pkg.S#coldStartup" in f.get("reason", "")]
